<beginCreatedObjects>
<beginStartingNarrative>
You are a project manager estimating the budget for a software development project. For each scenario, you are given a set of risks and opportunities that affect the effort estimate. Your task is to select the correct budget and contingency answers from four options.

Before playing, open the online questionnaire at:
https://chairegestionproduitsprojetslogiciels.github.io/simse-software-estimation-capability/questionnaires/game-f-questionnaire.html

The questionnaire contains all reference data and walks you through each calculation step by step.

The game has 9 scenario-profile combinations (3 scenarios and 3 manager profiles). Evaluate them in any order by clicking "Evaluate Scenario", selecting a combination, and entering your answers (1 to 4) for each of the five questions.

The End Game option becomes available after at least three scenario-profile combinations have been completed. Click it at any time thereafter to see your final score.

Good luck!
<endStartingNarrative>
